riel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"WaRZsQEcEHwRk0T2dJ-cuA","review_id":"Ih51pQbfRQUS6yCaC9Lcdw","date":"2014-02-04T08:49:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9455049633979797,"text_excerpt":"Walked in with my hubbub around 8:30 and the place only had 4 people at the bar. Although the place wasn't handicap accessible with the dining seats & tables, the owner, who I'm guessing, was still very helpful in accommodating us.( Yup, the chairs and tables are quite high!...you can only imagine w/ me being 4'10 and all..) Service was VERY attentive,..always asking if we needed anything else. Super nice & helpful so don't hesitate to ask about the menu, they know their stuff! Food; Salsa de Julia?..- pretty decent, good portion, flavors were all there with a kick, no sweetness( I like my salsa sweet,citrus,&&SPICY w/chunks. [$4] Guacamole & chips - guacamole had huge chunks of avocado! ..."},{"business_id":"WaRZsQEcEHwRk0T2dJ-cuA","review_id":"sLhEWe5tQ3WRgq5-ch20vg","date":"2016-05-16T14:13:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9448960423469543,"text_excerpt":"If you want to see a cleaner, quieter, and nicer side of New Orleans, take a short walk to the southwest of the Vieux Carre into the Arts District, and find this nice, little bar/restaurant waiting there like an old friend. We knew about the place from the Happy Cow website of vegan/vegetarian restaurants. So, we searched it out, and we were glad we did. We were especially happy to find the place during what happened to be Happy Hour. At Happy Hour, (3:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m. every day - We were there on a Sunday!), they have great drink specials, and great discounts on selected food items. To be exact it's $4 Margaritas, $5 for Mojitos or Sangria, $2 for Domestic Beers, $4.50 for the Guacam..."},{"business_id":"WaRZsQEcEHwRk0T2dJ-cuA","review_id":"MLn_zyXdurkF4twDlacArA","date":"2016-10-16T01:17:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9435822367668152,"text_excerpt":"Love their happy hour. The margaritas rock!!!! and the mojitos are yummy too. They have amazing $2 tacos and its half off guacomole, salsa, queso. My family and I can't decide which one is better because everyone in my family have a different favorite. The only thing that could be better about the place is to liven up the courtyard a bit. Maybe add some more plants and some lights strung across for more ambiance. Over all love this place."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"WaRZsQEcEHwRk0T2dJ-cuA","photo_id":"-rnzZlQNY8g9i36xe3oKHA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-rnzZlQNY8g9i36xe3oKHA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8805955052375793},{"business_id":"WaRZsQEcEHwRk0T2dJ-cuA","photo_id":"wPGCKIMIa-7bpldOC3T-Hg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/wPGCKIMIa-7bpldOC3T-Hg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8526941537857056},{"business_id":"WaRZsQEcEHwRk0T2dJ-cuA","photo_id":"_th4mWOZsrBip-Etj52F6Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_th4mWOZsrBip-Etj52F6Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8303691744804382},{"business_id":"WaRZsQEcEHwRk0T2dJ-cuA","photo_id":"C1SOjDLfNyro4P6XgUtJfA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/C1SOjDLfNyro4P6XgUtJfA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8277735710144043},{"business_id":"WaRZsQEcEHwRk0T2dJ-cuA","photo_id":"vXgfvt3B2ElsIvvneqC5yg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/vXgfvt3B2ElsIvvneqC5yg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7813711762428284}]},"notebook_case":null}
